odern (Gf Gie Rothst) read מַשְׂכִּיל , either skilful or fortunate. 6 prosper, have success (compare Dr 1Sam 18:5 ): absolute 18:15 ; Isa 52:13 ; Jer 10:21 ; 20:11 ; 23:5 ; Josh 1:8 (D); with ב , 1:7 (D) 1Sam 18:5 , 14 (read בְּכָלֿ for לְכָלֿ Vrss Th HPS and others), compare 2Kin 18:7 ; with אֶל , Prov 17:8 . 7 cause to prosper: Deut 29:8 ; 1Kin 2:3 (D). II. [ שָׂכַל ] verb Pi`el lay crosswise (so, and not √ I. ᵑ7 ᵑ9 ᵑ6 ᵐ5 ׳שׂ, Jon and modern, compare Arabic bind legs of beast, plait locks of hair); — Perfect 3masculine singular אֶתיָֿדָיו שִׂכֵּל Gen 48:14 (J); Thes Dr, however, prudentes fecit , from √ I. ׳שׂ .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 28 19","keyReferences":["1Chr 28 19","1Kgs 2 3","1Sam 18 5","1Sam 18 14","1Sam 18 15","1Sam 18 30","2Chr 30 22","2Kgs 18 7"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":63,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 28 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הִשְׂכִּ֑יל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 2 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":2,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תַּשְׂכִּ֗יל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhi2ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 18 5","book":"1Sam","chapter":18,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יַשְׂכִּ֔יל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhi3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 18 14","book":"1Sam","chapter":18,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַשְׂכִּ֑יל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhrmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 18 15","book":"1Sam","chapter":18,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַשְׂכִּ֣יל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhrmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 18 30","book":"1Sam","chapter":18,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שָׂכַ֤ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 30 22","book":"2Chr","chapter":30,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מַּשְׂכִּילִ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Vhrmpa"},{"refe